<title>USA: Tele-Communications Intl to buy back shrs.</title>
<headline>Tele-Communications Intl to buy back shrs.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tele-Communications International Inc said Monday it would initiate a repurchase program under which it may buy back from time to time up to 5.0 percent of its outstanding Series A common shares, or about 5.3 million shares.  </p>
<p>The company said in a release that repurchases could be made in the open market or in privately negotiated transactions.</p>
</text>
